{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A platformer/shooter inspired by the PS2 Ratchet and Clank games! A true love letter to the PS2 era!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/co_op.gif?t=1751004980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORE SPACE AND DISCOVER NEW WORLDS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/panorama_shot.gif?t=1751004980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the galaxy exploring all sorts of new worlds all controlled by the galXE Corporation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the lush jungles and white sand beaches of Relaxium (just watch out for the local population kidnapping tourists and forcing them to fight in a combat arena)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/gif_6.gif?t=1751004980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or the busy city skyline of Earth+ where striking robot union members make business hard to do</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1751004980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRY OUT FUTURISTIC NEW WEAPONS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out many of galXE's new weapons, including: The Fister 5000! Great for any situation... like if you want to punch someone in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"